# Rezbit state-body gaps (rez2), pass 2. Run merged with rezbit_states.con.
# B (layer 4): noise sets a non-zero mAlertDelay, Alert before/after it; placed on the player so the
# toTarget vector is zero (IsMagnitudeSafe false) in Alert/PathFind; then a laser and a kill with it live.
# A (layer 3): laser, then kill while the laser sfx is live (Dead removes mLaserSfx).
@f600 god 1
@f1000 layer 3
@f1300 layer 4
@f1302 place e00050065 player 15
@f1303 noise 0
@f1304 fsm e00050065 Alert
@f1400 place e00050065 player 0
@f1401 fsm e00050065 Alert
@f1420 fsm e00050065 PathFind
@f1440 place e00050065 player 15
@f1445 fsm e00050065 CuttingLaserAttack
@f1500 place e0005011b player 15
@f1600 fsm e0005011b CuttingLaserAttack
@f1640 obj e0005011b
@f1660 kill e0005011b
@f1700 obj e00050065
@f1720 kill e00050065
@f1800 objs rezbit
